  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is increasing function in given domain,</p><p>Now, finding <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></munder><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fee53ad0-c982-4d34-9163-0303b3b516c9.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 152px;\"/></p><p>Now, finding the distance from the given line we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p>",
